WEBVTT

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.520
I stayed up late last night, so I'm sleepy.

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:20.860
Do you want something from me, little girls?

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:22.950
We wouldn't call you if we didn't!

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.510
His sleepy face is wonderful.

00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:26.710
What's so wonderful?

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:29.240
We have a Prism Stone for you.

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:31.970
Just what I'd expect from 
the legendary Pretty Cure...

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:33.760
Your great efforts are magnificent.

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:38.650
Why are all the people from 
the Field of Light so glib?

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:40.440
Did you say something?

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:46.050
We got another Prism Stone 
into our possession!

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:47.490
We have a total of five.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:52.080
Before we realized it, we had five stones.

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:56.020
The revival of the Field of Light 
rests on your shoulders now.

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:57.130
I bid you farewell!

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.890
You shouldn't have such high expectations...

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:02.760
We can just barely get by now.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:04.040
Mipple?

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:07.770
What will happen if we get 
all seven Prism Stones?

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:13.260
The real power of the Prism Stones, 
the Power of Creation will appear,

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:16.150
and will bring the Field of 
Light back to light again mipo.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:19.990
Then will you and Mepple be able 
to go back to the Field of Light?

00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:22.530
We don't know that either mepo.

00:01:22.530 --> 00:01:25.930
But I'm sure we will mepo.

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:27.710
Just two more...

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:30.970
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:30.970 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:36.610
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:40.880
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:43.850
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:46.720
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:48.620
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:52.520
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:54.130
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:59.930
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:02.030
<i>become stronger</i>

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:05.800
<i>and closer</i>

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:09.810
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:12.380
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:15.550
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:18.420
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:24.690
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:25.590
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:28.290
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:31.100
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:34.000
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.570
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:35.570 --> 00:02:38.640
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:48.140
The power... you must get 
the Power of Creation!

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:52.990
The Field of Light will 
perish using it's own power.

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:56.490
The Stones... The seven stones!

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:59.410
Poisonny returned to darkness.

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:02.560
It's my destiny to defeat Pretty Cure.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.560
It wasn't supposed to turn out like this.

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:10.560
The power of Dotsuku Zone is the 
dark power to annihilate everything.

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:15.500
That power is already eating 
away at Jyaku-King's body.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:16.770
We don't have any time left.

00:03:17.320 --> 00:03:20.500
They've already taken 
back three of the stones.

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:23.610
All of them should be in one place.

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:26.110
If you defeat them, you're 
sure to get them back.

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:29.880
I'll settle this.

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:36.510
Don't forget that your existence 
alone is one with Jyaku-King.

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:40.920
They've definitely grown stronger.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.890
More than we can imagine.

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:46.830
Don't take the power of light lightly.

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:55.750
"A SHOCKING DATE! THE TRUTH ABOUT KIRIYA"

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:00.120
See you, Honoka!

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:01.050
Later.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:05.960
Kiriya-kun?

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:12.180
You haven't said a word, Kiriya-kun.

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:12.960
Is something wrong?

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:18.040
Do you like that school Honoka-san?

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:23.810
I guess... I have some good friends there.

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:25.660
I think I like it quite a bit.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:30.880
Ever since I transferred 
here, I haven't fit in.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:35.360
But now, I think I'm glad that I came here.

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:40.860
I had some fun, and I met 
you, too, Honoka-san.

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:44.770
That's right. We all went 
to help out at the farm.

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:47.070
That was a lot of fun.

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:48.500
Let's go again.

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:52.640
And besides, nothing like 
that has ever happened to me.

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:56.650
You apologized to me.

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:01.670
I really don't know what 
came over me that time...

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:07.150
It's okay... I've never had anyone 
treat me like that before.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.970
You're acting strange today, Kiriya-kun.

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:12.460
What's wrong?

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:19.660
It started to rain.

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:22.870
Here you go.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:26.310
Kiriya-kun?

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:32.540
I'm not going to school anymore.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:34.800
What do you mean?

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:37.330
I quit school.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:38.520
You quit?

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:41.950
Honoka...? Didn't you realize yet?

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:43.020
What?

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:45.650
What about that thing?

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:50.070
Even if I erased any signs...

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:53.720
Kiriya-kun... What are you saying?

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.050
I don't understand.

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:58.060
I'm different from everyone else...

00:05:58.620 --> 00:05:59.730
What do you mean?

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:02.200
Mipple...? Is that what you call it?

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:03.670
Why don't you ask Mipple?

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:05.740
She's sleeping right now.

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:08.080
Is that right?

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:25.220
Don't tell me, you're...? It can't be!

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:46.840
To get all seven stones away from 
you for the sake of Jyaku-King...

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.650
That's my mission.

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.610
You're lying, aren't you?

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:58.660
The only road left for me is 
to defeat you and Misumi-san...

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:00.380
That's the only way.

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:05.560
Then you know that we're Pretty Cure?

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:08.930
I cannot escape from my own destiny.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:11.040
No matter how hard I try.

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:13.410
Kiriya-kun...

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:21.680
If I had been born to this world,

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:24.470
then maybe my fate would have been different.

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:27.170
Fate...?

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:42.940
Honoka... you're acting strange mipo.

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:46.270
Did something happen today mipo?

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:48.910
Not really.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:50.490
You seem depressed mipo.

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:52.630
I wish you'd tell me everything mipo.

00:07:53.010 --> 00:07:54.080
Thank you.

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:59.430
Honoka... I'm coming in.

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:00.330
Ah, yes!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:03.130
What happened today?

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:06.100
You came home soaking wet,

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:08.040
and now you're sitting here in the dark.

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:11.020
Grandmother...?

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:12.140
What is it?

00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:13.810
Can I ask you something strange?

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:14.930
Something strange?

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:19.910
Is a person's fate something 
that can be changed?

00:08:20.090 --> 00:08:25.880
Fate? What made you ask such a 
difficult question all of a sudden?

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:29.180
Can you change it if you want to?

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:33.320
That's up to the person.

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:39.280
But it would take a lot 
of effort and patience

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:43.130
to change what a person thinks is his fate.

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:47.510
And there's one more important thing...

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:49.130
Something important?

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:54.680
The strength to come face-to-face 
with your own destiny.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:57.220
Strength...?

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:01.380
The weather cleared up.

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:03.920
Tomorrow's going to be a nice day.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:10.810
Come on in.

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:12.420
Sorry to call you all of a sudden.

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:15.970
It's Sunday, and I don't 
have anything to do anyway.

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:17.630
I brought some cookies...

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:19.860
My grandmother told me to bring them for you.

00:09:19.860 --> 00:09:21.070
Thank you.

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:23.770
Hello, Honoka-san!

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:25.730
I've been waiting for you.

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:28.300
Hello, Ryota.

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:30.740
Why are you waiting for her?

00:09:30.740 --> 00:09:33.560
Will you talk to me today?

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:35.440
She didn't come here to see you.

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:39.460
Go away!

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:44.670
My mom and dad aren't home today, 
so just wait in here for me.

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:54.740
Her room is cuter than I thought.

00:09:57.170 --> 00:09:58.470
Mipple!

00:09:58.470 --> 00:09:59.870
Mepple!

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:02.670
You're always so cool mipo!

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:05.180
How nice that you can always 
enjoy each other like that.

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:06.480
Did you say something mepo?

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.200
No, I didn't.

00:10:08.550 --> 00:10:09.600
Thanks for waiting!

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.870
I couldn't understand a word she said mipo.

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:25.260
"Don't let Ryota see you!

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:28.410
He doesn't know how to 
"knock before he come in."

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:29.740
That's what she said mepo.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.390
Gotcha mepo!

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:36.290
These potato chips are super good.

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:36.760
Here...

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:37.820
Thanks.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:44.860
What's up? It must be important to 
make a special trip to my house.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:49.580
I met Kiriya-kun after school yesterday...

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:51.340
You did?

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:55.250
And Kiriya-kun confessed to me...

00:10:58.430 --> 00:10:59.720
Are you okay?

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:06.390
I thought I was going to die.

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:08.010
He confessed to you? Are you serious?

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:12.620
What a surprise!

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:15.820
I never expected Kiriya-kun to 
confess his love for you, Honoka.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:17.450
Confess his love for you...

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:21.040
It's not that kind of confession.

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:22.840
Then what kind of confession...?

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:24.730
What kind of confession?

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:27.040
Actually, Kiriya-kun...

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.330
What about Kiriya-kun...?

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:31.680
Tell us... What about Kiriya-kun?

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:34.450
He's from Dotsuku Zone.

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:38.460
I see... So Kiriya-kun is from Dotsuku Zone.

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:41.140
Dotsuku Zone!

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:45.750
What are you saying?

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:49.690
It seems that he's a part of that 
group that came, and attacked us.

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:53.920
But... but he's always been close by.

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:58.230
He had lots of chances, so 
why didn't he attack us?

00:11:58.450 --> 00:11:59.950
That's true.

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:03.310
I won't know unless I ask Kiriya-kun.

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:04.210
But...

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:05.760
But what?

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:08.350
It's different now.

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:11.730
I think Kiriya-kun's made up his mind.

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:15.350
Then we're going to have 
to fight Kiriya-kun...

00:12:15.350 --> 00:12:16.740
What are we going to do?

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:20.780
I just can't imagine fighting 
against Kiriya-kun.

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:38.770
I can't even think of fighting 
against a friend from school.

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:40.660
It's totally impossible.

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:44.480
But we have to protect Mepple and Mipple.

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:46.690
What are we going to do?

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:53.120
At a time like this, it's up to you 
to get your act together, Nagisa!

00:12:58.140 --> 00:13:04.440
The only road left for me is 
to defeat you and Misumi-san...

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:06.340
That's the only way.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:11.930
What's wrong?

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:18.770
Tomorrow morning at 4 o'clock.

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:30.570
Kiriya-kun!

00:13:30.570 --> 00:13:32.840
Let's not do this!

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:34.590
We're all students from the same school.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:37.960
No... I just pretended to be one.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.500
I came from the world of darkness.

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:43.710
We need all seven of the Prism Stones,

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:46.370
so Jyaku-King can live on forever.

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:50.700
If you don't want to fight, then 
just hand over the Prism Stones!

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:51.820
No!

00:13:51.820 --> 00:13:53.260
We can't do that!

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:55.850
In that case, I have no choice.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:57.440
Wait, Kiriya-kun!

00:13:57.440 --> 00:14:00.350
What you're trying to do is wrong!

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:04.680
How can we allow you to 
destroy someone else's world

00:14:04.680 --> 00:14:06.310
just for your own sake?

00:14:06.510 --> 00:14:08.630
Shut up! I'm coming after you!

00:14:16.650 --> 00:14:19.450
Please... Come to your senses, Kiriya-kun.

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:22.140
This is the real me!

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:40.670
Kiriya-kun...

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:44.260
If you don't transform, he's 
going to destroy you mepo!

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:47.510
At this rate... You're 
in danger, Honoka mipo!

00:14:58.670 --> 00:15:01.050
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:17.960
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:20.660
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:24.540
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:27.840
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:15:28.850 --> 00:15:31.280
Go back to where you came from!

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:35.850
So you're finally ready to fight.

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:38.410
We're doing it to protect Mepple and Mipple!

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:39.910
If you want to blame it on something,

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.660
then blame it on the fates that 
brought the three of us together!

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:46.880
You can always change that fate!

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:52.830
I don't want to hear pointless 
arguments like that!

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:55.190
Not now! It's too late for that!

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:06.890
Black!

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:15.180
White!

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:29.670
He'll destroy you at this rate mepo!

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:33.330
Hurry and use the Pretty 
Cure Marble Screw mipo!

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:44.260
Aren't you going to use your usual technique?

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:45.770
I'm up for the challenge.

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:50.720
We're not going to use the 
Pretty Cure Marble Screw.

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:54.580
We couldn't do that to a friend!

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:56.840
I'm not your friend!

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:57.990
Liar!

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:02.600
Weren't you beginning to think 
that you were one of us?

00:17:03.610 --> 00:17:06.990
You and I think alike!

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:09.160
That's why we had so much fun together!

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:10.680
Be quiet!

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:21.080
It's not too late!

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:23.340
Have the courage to change your destiny!

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:25.550
Be quiet!

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:28.760
If I give up now, my only choice 
is to return to the darkness.

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:32.440
I'll make you understand even if I 
have to use brute force to do it!

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:37.430
You really looked like you were enjoying 
yourself when you played soccer!

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:49.690
Don't you understand what 
you're doing to Honoka yet?

00:17:49.690 --> 00:17:51.620
Honoka seriously tried to get to know you.

00:17:51.620 --> 00:17:54.650
She did her best to accept you.

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:56.450
She really looked like she was enjoying it,

00:17:56.450 --> 00:17:59.030
and she put all of her effort into it.

00:17:59.030 --> 00:18:02.840
Can't you understand how she feels?

00:18:14.890 --> 00:18:15.980
Not yet...

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:20.340
White!

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.370
We...

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:32.190
...won't lose.

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:34.990
Why?

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:38.310
Why do you have to go so far for 
the sake of the Field of Light?

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:40.180
It has nothing to do with you, does it?

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:44.660
Because we're the only ones who 
can protect the Field of Light,

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:45.990
and these two little creatures.

00:18:49.470 --> 00:18:51.720
No matter what happens to this body,

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:55.650
I refuse to hand over the Prism Stones!

00:18:57.710 --> 00:18:58.900
White!

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:00.940
Hang on!

00:19:01.980 --> 00:19:03.240
Honoka!

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:08.880
Is this how you wanted to see Honoka?

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:11.970
Would you go this far to 
take the Prism Stones away?

00:19:11.970 --> 00:19:13.760
Will you be satisfied with that?

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:35.170
I'm not strong enough to change my fate.

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:38.650
But it seems that the two 
of you have that power...

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:43.040
An extraordinary power that 
binds the two of you together...

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:45.800
The power to carve out your own destiny.

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:49.960
I can feel a strong power of the 
stones pulling against each other.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:53.260
It might be the two of you 
who brought out that power.

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:55.620
Kiriya-kun...

00:19:56.680 --> 00:20:01.690
But I can't turn my back 
on my own fate any longer.

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:05.070
Is that...?

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:07.630
Goodbye.

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:11.690
Kiriya-kun!

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:14.680
Don't tell me...!

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:17.010
You mustn't go!

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:18.620
Kiriya-kun!

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:22.940
Aren't you going to run away?

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:24.020
No...

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:29.200
You know the fate of those who 
go against Jyaku-King, don't you?

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:31.270
I'm prepared for it.

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:33.040
Kiriya-kun!

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:49.870
Kiriya-kun!

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:56.280
What is this power that you two have?

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:59.260
Aren't the legendary warriors from 
the Field of Light so powerful

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:03.000
that they can wrestle down 
everything with their power?

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:04.100
It's incomprehensible.

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:15.280
I wonder if Kiriya-kun 
enjoyed being in school.

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:19.540
After all, he was an ordinary 
middle school student, wasn't he?

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:23.710
He probably felt the same way we 
do when we go to school, didn't he?

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:25.190
Honoka...

00:21:25.190 --> 00:21:29.160
He understood about friends 
and teammates, didn't he?

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:33.320
Then why... why?

00:21:38.340 --> 00:21:39.450
Honoka...

00:21:45.410 --> 00:21:46.800
Kiriya-kun...

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:52.970
It's true that Kiriya-kun couldn't 
change the fate that he was born with.

00:21:53.990 --> 00:21:57.760
But didn't he show us that he had 
the courage to face his own destiny

00:21:57.760 --> 00:22:00.790
by giving us the Prism Stone in the end?

00:22:02.120 --> 00:22:03.260
Courage...?

00:22:03.680 --> 00:22:07.760
We need to respond to Kiriya-kun's courage,

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:12.640
and protect Mipple and 
Mepple to the very end.

00:22:22.160 --> 00:22:25.180
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:29.120
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.120 --> 00:22:29.880
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:32.460
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:35.500
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:38.040
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:42.070
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.610 --> 00:22:47.850
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.850 --> 00:22:52.180
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:55.250
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:59.760
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:06.260
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.370 --> 00:23:13.870
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:20.380
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:23.110
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:26.350
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:28.520
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.520 --> 00:23:32.120
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.120 --> 00:23:35.330
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.330 --> 00:23:38.130
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:40.370
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.370 --> 00:23:43.030
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.030 --> 00:23:49.610
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:54.080 --> 00:23:55.970
What? Chutaro gave birth to puppies.

00:23:55.970 --> 00:23:58.010
There's no way that Chutaro 
can give birth to puppies.

00:23:58.010 --> 00:23:58.920
Really?

00:23:58.920 --> 00:23:59.990
After all, Chutaro is...

00:23:59.990 --> 00:24:01.160
It has a collar.

00:24:01.160 --> 00:24:02.540
It's probably lost.

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:03.560
Let's go and find its owner.

00:24:03.830 --> 00:24:05.380
Oh no! Not again!

00:24:05.380 --> 00:24:06.680
And it's him!

00:24:06.680 --> 00:24:07.630
What are we going to do?

00:24:09.290 --> 00:24:11.800
"YOU'RE KIDDING! 
CHUTARO'S GOING TO BE A MOM?!"

00:24:11.790 --> 00:24:13.780
Chutaro's a temporary mother, isn't he?

00:24:13.780 --> 00:24:15.270
That's right he is.

00:24:15.270 --> 00:24:16.740
But Chutaro's a male!

00:24:16.740 --> 00:24:20.030
You should have said so earlier!
